---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout title="Join" description="Join Surrey Artificial Intelligence Society — find out how to become a member, what you'll get, and how to stay connected.">

  <header class="bg-ai-surface text-ai-fg py-16 sm:py-24 px-6 relative border-b border-ai-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
        <span class="w-8 h-px bg-ai-cyan"></span>
        <span class="font-mono-tech text-ai-cyan text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Membership</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4">Join the Society</h1>
      <p class="text-ai-fg-muted text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Connect with developers, researchers, and AI enthusiasts. Open to all students at the University of Surrey regardless of course.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 px-6 bg-ai-bg text-ai-fg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-start">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-3">
          <section class="mb-16">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 font-mono-tech">Why Join?</h2>
            <div class="space-y-6">
              {[
                "Access to all technical workshops, build nights, and hackathons.",
                "Join collaborative open-source AI projects.",
                "Be part of a multidisciplinary network of AI-curious students.",
                "Early access to careers events and industry panels.",
                "Shape the society's direction and propose event topics."
              ].map((text) => (
                <div class="flex gap-4">
                  <span class="font-mono-tech text-ai-cyan mt-1">&rarr;</span>
                  <p class="text-ai-fg-muted leading-relaxed">{text}</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 font-mono-tech">Who Can Join?</h2>
            <div class="bg-ai-surface border border-ai-border p-6 sm:p-8">
              <p class="text-ai-fg mb-4">
                <strong>No prior experience required.</strong>
              </p>
              <p class="text-ai-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
                You do not need to be studying computer science to join. AI impacts every field — we actively welcome members from law, business, arts, and biosciences. Many of our events assume zero prior coding knowledge.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <aside class="lg:col-span-2">
          <div class="border border-ai-border bg-ai-bg p-8 sticky top-24">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 font-mono-tech text-ai-cyan">Join the Society</h2>
            <p class="text-ai-fg-muted mb-8 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Official membership is processed securely through the Surrey Students' Union platform.
            </p>
            
            <div class="w-full block py-4 px-6 bg-ai-surface/50 border border-ai-border-strong text-ai-fg-muted font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm text-center">
              <span class="font-mono-tech">Membership Opening Soon</span>
            </div>
            <p class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-ai-fg-muted mt-4 text-center">
              Check back soon or follow our social channels for activation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </aside>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 px-6 bg-ai-surface border-t border-ai-border text-ai-fg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 font-mono-tech">FAQ</h2>
          <dl class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <dt class="font-bold mb-2">Do I need to know how to code?</dt>
              <dd class="text-ai-fg-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">No. We run dedicated non-technical tracks covering AI ethics, implications, and tooling for non-programmers.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-bold mb-2">Is there a membership fee?</dt>
              <dd class="text-ai-fg-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Fees are standardized and set via the Students' Union. Exact figures will be displayed on the SU portal.</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-bold mb-2">I'm a first-year. Is this for me?</dt>
              <dd class="text-ai-fg-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Absolutely. We start from first principles. It's the perfect time to get involved.</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8 font-mono-tech">Contact</h2>
          <div class="grid gap-4">
            <div class="border border-ai-border bg-ai-bg p-5 flex items-center justify-between">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold">Instagram</h3>
                <p class="text-ai-fg-muted text-sm">@surreyai (Pending)</p>
              </div>
              <span class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-ai-cyan px-2 py-1 bg-ai-surface">COMING SOON</span>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-ai-border bg-ai-bg p-5 flex items-center justify-between">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold">Email</h3>
                <p class="text-ai-fg-muted text-sm">su.ai@surrey.ac.uk</p>
              </div>
              <a href="mailto:su.ai@surrey.ac.uk" class="font-mono-tech text-xs text-ai-purple px-2 py-1 bg-ai-surface hover:bg-ai-border transition-colors">EMAIL US</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
